      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F00690020003F00200049006C007300200073006F006E00740020006400650020007200650074006F007500720020003F002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a qu’à moi que ça arrive, ce genre de truc...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
