      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006320190065007300740020006400650073002000540065007200680061006C0020003F0020005420190065006E0020006100730020006400650020006C00610020006300680061006E00630065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Leurs corps sont des aimants, du coup ils adorent\nles ondes électromagnétiques des Holoporteurs.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’ils sont là, c’est la preuve que tu l’as bien\ninstallé. Allez, je retourne à mon poste !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça veut dire que... ces Terhal aiment bien\nmon Holoporteur ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200076006500750074002000640069007200650020007100750065002E002E002E0020006300650073002000540065007200680061006C002000610069006D0065006E00740020006200690065006E000A006D006F006E00200048006F006C006F0070006F007200740065007500720020003F00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rharhal !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200680061007200680061006C002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand on y pense... s’ils sont là, on saura\ntout de suite si une panne survient !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai une idée ! Je vais les attraper\npour en faire mes partenaires !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200075006E006500200069006400E90065002000210020004A0065002000760061006900730020006C00650073002000610074007400720061007000650072000A0070006F0075007200200065006E0020006600610069007200650020006D00650073002000700061007200740065006E006100690072006500730020002100100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouf... J’ai réussi à les attraper tous les quatre...\nIls vont bien m’aider dans mon boulot !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé ! Tu devineras jamais !\nMes Terhal ont évolué en Métang !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe peux plus me passer d’eux au travail !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regarde ça ! Mes Terhal ont évolué\nen Métalosse !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est la preuve que les Holoporteurs\nque j’installe fonctionnent parfaitement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
